  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding and Preventing Violent Extremism in East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Individuals, communities and institutions resilience strengthened, and early warning and response mechanisms and capacities are enhanced&#xd3ed;&#xb825;&#xc801; &#xadf9;&#xb2e8;&#xc8fc;&#xc758; &#xbc0f; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1; &#xd574;&#xacb0;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xcee4;&#xbba4;&#xb2c8;&#xd2f0; &#xd68c;&#xbcf5;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xd3c9;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xc870;&#xc131;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To bolster community resilience by focusing on strengthening socio-economic capacities and access to livelihoods, particularly among at-risk youth and other vulnerable groups in target locations. This objective is attained through various means, including the provision of employment and livelihood support opportunities. The approach involves comprehensive skills-building programs,at fostering entrepreneurship, and providing mentorship opportunities. Additionally, the initiative aims to fortify community anticipatory and response capabilities by enhancing early warning and early response mechanisms, both in online and offline spaces.</narrative>
  </description>
